  "name": "knowledge_base_md_for_rag_1",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tHF Knowledge-Base Markdown Collection\n\t\n\nThis repository contains a collection of Markdown-based knowledge bases generated from:\n\nUser-provided notes and attachments  \nHugging Face Docs, Blog, and Papers  \nModel / Dataset / Space cards  \nDiscussions, GitHub issues, forums, and other vetted community sources\n\nEach .md file is intended to be a self-contained knowledge pack that can be used as\nLLM context for RAG or prompt-attachment workflows (e.g. ChatGPT, Hugging Face Inference\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/John6666/knowledge_base_md_for_rag_1.",
